questions.q:
The week's summary sheet gives this class. Which part of it makes it a class rather than a structure?
class Dog {
    char name[20];
    char breed[20];
    char colour[20];
    char[] get_name() { return name; }
};

What does this print?
union Dog { char name[20]; char breed[20]; char colour[20]; };
union Dog d;
strcpy(d.name, "Rex");
strcpy(d.breed, "Poodle");
printf("%s %s", d.name, d.breed);
